flowchart TB
  U([User<br/>EN · Tamil · Tanglish · Hindi<br/>text and/or image]) --> UI[Streamlit UI :8501<br/>pipeline view · compare · admin · health]
  UI --> GW
  subgraph API["Query path (stateless, horizontally scalable)"]
    GW[Gateway / Query API :8000<br/>orchestration · timeouts · circuit breakers<br/>rate limit · response cache · tracing]
    IN[Intent service :8001<br/>lang-ID → LLM decomposition*<br/>→ normalisation → rule fallback]
    EM[Embedding service :8002<br/>multilingual-e5-small int8 ONNX<br/>OpenCLIP ViT-B/32 ONNX]
    RT[Retrieval service :8003<br/>incremental BM25 + Qdrant ANN<br/>hard filters pushed down · RRF]
    RK[Ranking service :8004<br/>constraints → context-adaptive fusion<br/>→ grounded explanations]
  end
  GW -->|1 parse| IN
  GW -->|2 embed query / image| EM
  GW -->|3 retrieve + filters| RT
  GW -->|4 rerank + explain| RK
  IN -.->|optional, free tier| LLM[(LLM: Groq / Gemini /<br/>OpenRouter / Ollama)]
  RK -.->|optional polish,<br/>grounding-checked| LLM
  subgraph DATA["Catalogue path (event-driven, incremental)"]
    CAT[Catalogue service :8005<br/>CRUD · validation · enrichment<br/>transactional outbox]
    IDX[Indexer worker :8006<br/>batch embed text+image<br/>upsert / delete points]
  end
  ADM([Merchandiser / feed]) -->|ADD · UPDATE · DELETE| GW
  GW -->|admin proxy| CAT
  CAT --> PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>products JSONB + outbox)]
  CAT -->|outbox relay| RS[(Redis Streams<br/>catalogue.events)]
  RS -->|group: indexer| IDX
  RS -->|group per replica| RT
  IDX --> EM
  IDX --> QD[(Qdrant<br/>named vectors: text 384 · image 512<br/>payload indexes for filters)]
  RT --> QD
  GW <--> RC[(Redis cache<br/>responses keyed by catalogue version)]
  EM <--> RC
  classDef store fill:#eef,stroke:#557;
  class PG,RS,QD,RC,LLM store;
